---
/**
 * Reconstruction osseuse pré-implantaire : crête trop fine → os reconstruit → implant posé.
 * Coupe verticale de la crête osseuse. Matériau de comblement = teal pointillé.
 */
---

<figure class="my-10 md:my-12">

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 md:gap-5">

    <!-- 1. Crête trop fine -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl p-4 md:p-5 text-center" style="background: var(--color-cream-50); border: 1px solid var(--color-cream-300)">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" role="img" aria-label="Crête osseuse trop fine" class="w-full max-w-[160px] mx-auto">
        <!-- Crête très fine -->
        <path d="M 78 190 L 82 70 C 83 59 86 52 92 50 C 98 52 101 59 102 70 L 106 190 Z"
              style="fill: var(--color-cream-200); stroke: var(--color-ink-300); stroke-width: 2" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        <!-- Implant fantôme plus LARGE que la crête : il déborde, ça ne rentre pas -->
        <path d="M 76 64 L 108 64 L 104 132 C 102 140 82 140 80 132 Z" style="fill: none; stroke: var(--color-ink-400); stroke-width: 2; stroke-dasharray: 4 4" />
        <!-- Croix : impossible -->
        <line x1="128" y1="80" x2="152" y2="104" style="stroke: var(--color-copper-600); stroke-width: 3" stroke-linecap="round" />
        <line x1="152" y1="80" x2="128" y2="104" style="stroke: var(--color-copper-600); stroke-width: 3" stroke-linecap="round" />
      </svg>
      <div class="mt-3 text-[16.5px] font-medium" style="font-family: var(--font-display)">Crête trop fine</div>
      <p class="mt-1.5 text-[12.5px] leading-[1.55] text-ink-500">L'os a fondu depuis la perte de la dent : le volume ne suffit plus pour ancrer un implant.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- 2. Os reconstruit -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl p-4 md:p-5 text-center" style="background: var(--color-cream-50); border: 1px solid var(--color-cream-300)">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" role="img" aria-label="Os reconstruit par greffe" class="w-full max-w-[160px] mx-auto">
        <!-- Crête d'origine -->
        <path d="M 80 190 L 86 70 C 87 58 92 50 100 48 C 108 50 113 58 114 70 L 120 190 Z"
              style="fill: var(--color-cream-200); stroke: var(--color-ink-300); stroke-width: 2" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        <!-- Greffe (matériau de comblement, accolé au flanc) -->
        <path d="M 86 70 C 74 76 64 92 60 116 C 57 138 60 165 66 190 L 84 190 C 80 160 80 120 86 70 Z"
              style="fill: var(--color-teal-200); stroke: var(--color-teal-600); stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-dasharray: 1 0" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        <!-- Granules du matériau -->
        <g style="fill: var(--color-teal-600)">
          <circle cx="72" cy="100" r="2.2" /><circle cx="68" cy="120" r="2.2" /><circle cx="74" cy="138" r="2.2" />
          <circle cx="69" cy="158" r="2.2" /><circle cx="76" cy="172" r="2.2" /><circle cx="78" cy="115" r="2.2" />
        </g>
        <!-- Membrane (trait courbe par-dessus) -->
        <path d="M 88 64 C 70 72 58 96 55 124 C 53 148 56 170 62 190" style="fill: none; stroke: var(--color-copper-500); stroke-width: 2.4" stroke-linecap="round" />
      </svg>
      <div class="mt-3 text-[16.5px] font-medium" style="font-family: var(--font-display)">Os reconstruit</div>
      <p class="mt-1.5 text-[12.5px] leading-[1.55] text-ink-500">Un matériau de comblement, protégé par une membrane, recrée le volume. L'os le colonise en quelques mois.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3. Implant posé -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl p-4 md:p-5 text-center" style="background: var(--color-cream-50); border: 1px solid var(--color-cream-300)">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" role="img" aria-label="Implant posé dans l'os reconstruit" class="w-full max-w-[160px] mx-auto">
        <!-- Crête élargie (os + greffe intégrée) -->
        <path d="M 58 190 L 62 96 C 64 70 76 52 100 50 C 124 52 136 70 138 96 L 142 190 Z"
              style="fill: var(--color-cream-200); stroke: var(--color-ink-300); stroke-width: 2" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        <!-- Implant bien ancré -->
        <path d="M 90 58 L 110 58 L 107 140 C 105 148 95 148 93 140 Z" style="fill: var(--color-teal-400); stroke: var(--color-teal-700); stroke-width: 1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" />
        <line x1="90" y1="76" x2="110" y2="76" style="stroke: var(--color-teal-700); stroke-width: 1.4" />
        <line x1="91" y1="94" x2="109" y2="94" style="stroke: var(--color-teal-700); stroke-width: 1.4" />
        <line x1="92" y1="112" x2="108" y2="112" style="stroke: var(--color-teal-700); stroke-width: 1.4" />
        <line x1="93" y1="128" x2="107" y2="128" style="stroke: var(--color-teal-700); stroke-width: 1.4" />
        <!-- Coche -->
        <circle cx="162" cy="38" r="15" style="fill: var(--color-teal-400); stroke: var(--color-teal-700); stroke-width: 1.6" />
        <polyline points="154,38 160,44 170,32" style="fill: none; stroke: var(--color-cream-50); stroke-width: 3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
      </svg>
      <div class="mt-3 text-[16.5px] font-medium" style="font-family: var(--font-display)">Implant posé</div>
      <p class="mt-1.5 text-[12.5px] leading-[1.55] text-ink-500">Le volume retrouvé, l'implant s'ancre dans de bonnes conditions — stable et durable.</p>
    </div>

  </div>

  <figcaption class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-[12px] text-ink-500">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded" style="background: var(--color-cream-200); border: 1px solid var(--color-ink-300)"></span> Os naturel</span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded" style="background: var(--color-teal-200); border: 1px solid var(--color-teal-600)"></span> Matériau de comblement</span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded" style="background: var(--color-copper-300); border: 1px solid var(--color-copper-500)"></span> Membrane</span>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded" style="background: var(--color-teal-400); border: 1px solid var(--color-teal-700)"></span> Implant</span>
  </figcaption>

</figure>
